 "description": "Great sailing adventures begin with great boats. Aquila's all-new 45 sail catamaran delivers thoughtful design that maximizes space, functionality, cruising comfort, and quality. Every detail matters when you're living aboard, from our innovative fixed bow for entertaining and relaxing, to an aft cockpit designed for everything from family dinners to sunset celebrations.\nInside, panoramic windows frame nature's theater while spacious salons and galleys become your command center. Choose from 3 or 4 cabin configurations, each with private entrances that preserve personal sanctuary. Bridge-to-bow access allows quick and easy access from the flybridge to the foredeck cockpit, while generous interiors provide genuine comfort during extended passages.\nWhether pursuing private ownership or charter opportunities, this catamaran offers the quality and cruising excellence Aquila is renowned for with innovations that elevate your sailing experience.\nTHE 45 SAIL MAKES HER DEBUT Schedule your private viewing at the Annapolis Sailboat Show.",
